{"unit_id":"tag:0DFH:proof","translation":"我们将证明 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）是 ph 覆盖（covering），其余结论便由引理 <REF_0001> 得到。设 <MATH_0001> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），其基概形（base scheme）为 <MATH_0002>。设 <MATH_0003> 是仿射概形（affine scheme），<MATH_0004> 是态射（morphism）。可以将 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0005> 细化（refine）为 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0006>，其中 <MATH_0007> 是概形（scheme）（引理 <REF_0002>）。于是由《态射（Morphisms）进阶》引理 <REF_0003>（以及概形（schemes）的 ph 覆盖（coverings）的定义），可以找到标准（standard）ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0008>，它细化（refining）<MATH_0009>。因此由定义，<MATH_0010> 是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refine","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"给定及细化覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"ph覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形","context":"共同基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"测试对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"测试态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"refine","target_t