{"unit_id":"tag:0DFI:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是满射（surjective）的真态射（proper morphism），其对象是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。则 <MATH_0004> 是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"真态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"给定态射性质；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"真态射","context":"给定态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"ph覆盖结论；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFI:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是态射（morphism），其中 <MATH_0002> 是仿射（affine）的。由 Chow 引理（使用《代数空间的上同调（Cohomology of Spaces）》引理 <REF_0001> 中给出的弱形式），可知存在满射（surjective）的概形（schemes）真态射（proper morphism）<MATH_0003>，它通过 <MATH_0004> 分解。取 <MATH_0005> 的任意有限（finite）仿射开（affine open）覆盖（cover），就得到 <MATH_0006> 的标准（standard）ph 覆盖（covering），它细化（refining）<MATH_0007>，符合要求。\n","allowed_english":["Chow","ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"Cohomology of Spaces","target_term":"代数空间的上同调"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"真态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"细化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"测试态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"测试对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Cohomology of Spaces","target_term":"代数空间的上同调","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"Chow引理给出的态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"Chow引理给出的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"真态射","context":"Chow引理给出的态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"仿射开覆盖的大小；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"所取覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖","context":"所取开覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准","context":"标准ph覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"所得ph覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"细化","context":"所得覆盖的关系；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFJ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若 <MATH_0004> 是同构（isomorphism），则 <MATH_0005> 是 ph 覆盖（covering），覆盖 <MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若 <MATH_0007> 是 ph 覆盖（covering），且对每个 <MATH_0008> 都有 ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，则 <MATH_0010> 是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若 <MATH_0011> 是 ph 覆盖（covering），且 <MATH_0012> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），则 <MATH_0013> 是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"首条公理；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"ph覆盖公理；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"第三条中的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"第三条；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFJ:proof","translation":"第 (1) 项是显然的。考虑 <MATH_0001> 及第 (3) 项中的 ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0002>。由《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0001>，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003> 是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。若 <MATH_0004> 是从仿射概形（affine scheme）到 <MATH_0005> 的态射（morphism），则令 <MATH_0006>。关于 <MATH_0007> 的假设意味着存在标准（standard）ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0008> 及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0009>，它们位于（covering）<MATH_0010> 上方，对应某些 <MATH_0011>。由纤维积（fibre product）的泛性质（universal property），还得到态射（morphisms）<MATH_0012>，其基底为 <MATH_0013>。因此 <MATH_0014> 是 ph 覆盖（covering）。这就证明了 (3)。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设 <MATH_0015> 和 <MATH_0016> 如第 (2) 项所述。设 <MATH_0017> 是从仿射概形（affine scheme）到 <MATH_0018> 的态射（morphism）。由假设，存在标准（standard）ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0019> 及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0020>，它们位于（covering）<MATH_0021> 上方，对应某些指标 <MATH_0022>。由假设，存在标准（standard）ph 覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0023> 及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0024>，它们位于（covering）<MATH_0025> 上方，对应某些指标 <MATH_0026>。由《拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0002>，族（family）<MATH_0027> 可以被标准（standard）ph 覆盖（covering）细化（refined）。因此得出 <MATH_0028> 是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"位于"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"universal property","target_term":"泛性质"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphisms